#### 3. Poor Test Naming (all 10 tests)

Every test is named `MethodName_Works`. This conveys no information about the scenario under test or the expected outcome. When a test fails in CI, `UpdatePrice_Works FAILED` tells you nothing.

Use the `Method_Scenario_Expected` convention:

